{"parse": {"title": "Bulby", "pageid": 561, "revid": 46427, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><center>\n<div class=\"game-font-face TEST\" style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-left: 4px solid #FFC71E; border-right: 4px solid #FFC71E; width: calc(70% + 30px); background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 40% 70%,#00000042 35%, #ffec90 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 0 9px 0 #f6d100, 0 0 6px 0 #ff002447; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 85%; background-position-y: top; background-position-x: -13px; background-size: 150% 110%; margin: 6px 0 0; line-height: 1.25; color: #dcdce6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 140%;color: hwb(240deg 86% 0%);\">Meta Unit</span><br />This unit is one of the most effective units in the game!</div>\n</center><center>\n<div class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-left: 4px solid #22FF22; border-right: 4px solid #55FF55; width: calc(70% + 30px); background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 40% 70%,#00000042 35%, #00FF00 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 0 9px 0 #22FF22, 0 0 6px 0 #ff002447; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 85%; background-position-y: top; background-position-x: -13px; background-size: 150% 110%; margin: 6px 0 0; line-height: 1.25; color: #dcdce6;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 140%;color: hwb(240deg 86% 0%);\">Meta Support Unit</span><br />This unit has one of the BEST supporting abilities in-game!<span style=\"font-size: 105%;\"></span></div>\n</center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\"><b>Overview</b></span></h2>\n<p><b>Bulby</b> is a <span class=\"C(Legendary) Tsh(Game) game-font-face\">Legendary</span> unit. She is only obtainable through <a href=\"/wiki/Summon\" title=\"Summon\">summons</a>.\n</p><p>She is recommended for <a href=\"/wiki/Infinite\" title=\"Infinite\">Infinite Mode</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Raids\" title=\"Raids\">Raids</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Legend_Stages\" title=\"Legend Stages\">Legend Stages</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stats_Overview\">Stats Overview</span></h2>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-character\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Bulby</h2>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\" data-item-name=\"img\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-item-name=\"section1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOriginal Skin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\" data-item-name=\"section1\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/e3/Bulby.png/revision/latest?cb=20250105024535\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Bulby\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/e3/Bulby.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250105024535\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/e3/Bulby.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250105024535 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/e3/Bulby.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20250105024535 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Bulby\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Bulby.png\" data-image-name=\"Bulby.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t<figcaption class=\"pi-item-spacing pi-caption\">\"Somebody help me! I'm too young and pretty to die!\"</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"deployment_cost\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Deployment Cost</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 3px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black;color: #ffc608;\">800¥</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"total_cost\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Total Cost</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 3px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black;color: #ffc608;\">39,800¥</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"upgrade_levels\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Upgrade Levels</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"spawn_cap\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Spawn Cap</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Tower_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Tower Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ground FARM</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Attack Stats</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damage\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Damage</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 -&gt;</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"seconds_per_attack\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Attack Rate</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 -&gt;</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"range\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class